(If you are reading this, you are already doing the single most important thing an expectant mother) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 525.50 Tm
(can do: you are paying attention.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 503.00 Tm
(You do not need to be a nutritionist. You do not need a perfect kitchen, a big budget, or a fridge full) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 486.50 Tm
(of exotic superfoods. You need a handful of simple habits, a little patience with yourself, and the) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 470.00 Tm
(confidence to know that every small, good choice counts - for you and for the tiny person you are) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 453.50 Tm
(growing.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 431.00 Tm
(This book is different from most pregnancy nutrition guides. Instead of dumping a mountain of rules) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 414.50 Tm
(on you, it walks beside you through the whole journey - trimester by trimester - the way a) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 398.00 Tm
(knowledgeable friend would. In each chapter you will find:) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 376.50 Tm
(- A short true-to-life story about a mother facing the same thing you are.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 361.00 Tm
(- A plain-language explanation of what your body and baby actually need right now.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 345.50 Tm
(- A gentle exercise or reflection to make the idea your own.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 330.00 Tm
