(Chapter 1: The Only Five Rules You Really Need) Tj
0.720 0.470 0.100 rg
/F2 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 652.50 Tm
(Amara's Sticky Note) Tj
0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 637.00 Tm
(When Amara found out she was pregnant, she went straight to the internet and came back) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 621.50 Tm
(terrified. There were a thousand rules, half of them contradicting each other, and by midnight she) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 606.00 Tm
(was convinced she would poison her baby with a cup of tea. She barely slept. The next morning) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 590.50 Tm
(her midwife laughed kindly and said, "Put the laptop away. There are really only about five things) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 575.00 Tm
(that matter. Write them on a sticky note and stick it on your fridge." Amara did exactly that. The) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 559.50 Tm
(panic drained away. For the rest of her pregnancy, when she felt overwhelmed, she looked at the) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 544.00 Tm
(fridge - five lines, no fear - and knew she was doing fine.) Tj
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 513.50 Tm
(Pregnancy nutrition can feel enormous, but almost everything worth doing fits under five simple) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 497.00 Tm
(principles. Master these and you have mastered eighty percent of the whole subject.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 474.50 Tm
(1. Drink plenty of water. Water flushes toxins, fights the puffy swelling \(edema\) that comes with) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 458.00 Tm
(pregnancy, and eases constipation and headaches. Aim to sip steadily all day rather than gulping a) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 441.50 Tm
(lot at once.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 419.00 Tm
(2. Favor whole foods over processed foods. Processed foods are packed with fillers, added sugar,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 402.50 Tm
(and sodium, and they encourage fluid retention and excess weight. Whole foods - fresh produce,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 386.00 Tm
(whole grains, lean protein - give you far more nutrition per bite. You do not have to be perfect; start) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 369.50 Tm
(by making just one meal a day a whole-food meal.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 347.00 Tm
(3. Buy organic where it matters most. Organic is worth prioritizing for dairy, meat, and eggs, and for) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 330.50 Tm
(the fruits and vegetables that carry the most pesticide residue: peaches, celery, apples, strawberries,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 314.00 Tm
(blueberries, spinach, bell peppers, kale, cherries, grapes, and potatoes. Wash all produce well.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 291.50 Tm
(4. Put a vegetable on every plate. Vegetables bring fiber \(goodbye, constipation\), fill you up, and) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 275.00 Tm
(deliver a flood of nutrients for very few calories. Make them the thing you reach for first.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 252.50 Tm
(5. Include a healthy fat at every meal. Olive oil, organic butter, coconut oil, raw nuts, nut butters, and) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 236.00 Tm
(avocado keep you full and - crucially - support your baby's brain and cognitive development.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 213.50 Tm
(That's it. Five rules. Everything else in this book is simply these five ideas, applied to the season of) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 197.00 Tm
(pregnancy you happen to be in.) Tj
