0.120 0.120 0.120 rg
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 273.00 Tm
(Lena couldn't keep anything down. The smell of her own kitchen sent her running, and she started) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 257.50 Tm
(to panic that her baby was starving. An older neighbor who'd raised four children knocked on her) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 242.00 Tm
(door with a sleeve of plain crackers and a thumb of fresh ginger. "Eat two crackers before your) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 226.50 Tm
(feet even touch the floor," she said. "And nibble ginger when it hits." It wasn't a cure, but it was) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 211.00 Tm
(enough. Lena learned to eat tiny bits often, to keep nuts in her bag, and to forgive the days when) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 195.50 Tm
(toast was the only victory. The nausea passed by week fourteen, exactly as her neighbor) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 180.00 Tm
(promised - and her baby was perfectly fine all along.) Tj
0.000 0.000 0.000 rg
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 149.50 Tm
(The first trimester is a season of enormous change, and for many mothers the biggest daily) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 133.00 Tm
(challenge is morning sickness - which, cruelly, is not confined to mornings. It's driven by the flood of) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 116.50 Tm
(new hormones your body is adjusting to.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 94.00 Tm
(The golden rule of the first trimester is go slow and be gentle with yourself. Making drastic dietary) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 77.50 Tm
(changes overnight tends to backfire and pile on stress. Ease in.) Tj
