1 0 0 1 74.00 141.00 Tm
(In her last month, Yuki felt like there was no room left inside her for a full dinner - and when she) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 125.50 Tm
(tried, heartburn kept her up half the night. Miserable, she mentioned it at her check-up. "Stop) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 110.00 Tm
(eating three big meals," her midwife said simply. "Eat six tiny ones." It felt strange at first, grazing) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 94.50 Tm
(all day like that, but the heartburn eased, her energy steadied, and eating stopped being a battle.) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 79.00 Tm
(On the day her daughter was born, Yuki realized the last stretch had been made bearable by the) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf
1 0 0 1 74.00 63.50 Tm
(smallest change of all: less on the plate, more often.) Tj
