(As your baby grows and presses on your stomach, the third trimester often brings heartburn,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 693.00 Tm
(indigestion, and constipation. The single most helpful eating change now is to shift from a few big) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 676.50 Tm
(meals to small meals, more often. Smaller portions are gentler on your crowded, hardworking) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 660.00 Tm
(digestion and keep your energy steady.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 637.50 Tm
(A few comfort strategies for the home stretch:) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 616.00 Tm
(- Graze, don't gorge. Five or six small meals beat three large ones.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 600.50 Tm
(- Include healthy fats to keep digestion moving smoothly and to keep fueling your baby's brain.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 585.00 Tm
(- Keep fiber and water high to fight constipation - vegetables, fruit, whole grains, and steady) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 569.50 Tm
(    sipping.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 554.00 Tm
(- Don't lie down right after eating, which worsens heartburn \(a comfort tip beyond nutrition, but a) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 76.00 538.50 Tm
(    welcome one\).) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 516.00 Tm
(By now, if you've been eating well along the way, weight gain in this trimester often runs around a) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 499.50 Tm
(pound a week - roughly 12 pounds across the final trimester. Your baby is busy converting) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 483.00 Tm
(everything you eat into the fuel for its final growth spurt.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 460.50 Tm
(And then - sooner than it feels right now - it's over. You'll be holding your baby, and pounds lighter,) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 444.00 Tm
(and this whole season will become a story you tell. You're almost there.) Tj
