1 0 0 1 60.00 709.50 Tm
(You survived the queasy weeks with ginger and crackers and a lot of self-forgiveness. You built your) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 693.00 Tm
(baby with the Big Three, powered the golden second trimester with protein, made peace with your) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 676.50 Tm
(cravings, and carried the final build home on a handful of seeds and six small meals a day.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 654.00 Tm
(Here's the beautiful secret nobody tells you: these habits don't end at birth. The whole-food plate, the) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 637.50 Tm
(water within reach, the healthy fats, the small frequent meals - these are exactly what will carry you) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 621.00 Tm
(through recovery, through breastfeeding if you choose it, and into feeding a growing child. You) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 604.50 Tm
(haven't just prepared for a birth. You've built a way of eating that your whole family can grow into.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 582.00 Tm
(You paid attention. You did the work. You nourished a life.) Tj
/F1 11.00 Tf
1 0 0 1 60.00 559.50 Tm
(Now rest, mama. Meet your baby. You've earned this.) Tj
